HB0080 Stop ESG-State funds fiduciary duty act.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Knapp, Angelos, Banks, Bear,
Haroldson, Neiman, Singh, Tarver, Webb and Winter and
Senator(s) Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to the administration of the government; specifying requirements
for the hiring and retention of investment managers, trustees and fiduciaries
who invest state funds as specified; specifying proxy voting requirements for
investment managers, trustees and fiduciaries who invest state funds; providing
definitions; making conforming amendments; specifying applicability; and
providing for an effective date.
